  "notes": "A studio–client chart review workspace. Distinctive features: (1) a version strip where each sent version (v1–v3, plus v4 not started with a dashed outline) swaps the chart to that version as sent; (2) preview toggles above the chart (axis floor, 2020 span, corrected value) plus a 'Preview only. Nothing here changes v3 as sent' banner; (3) chart months can be clicked to pin them, which adds a removable 'Pinned · Jan 2024 · 79.7%' chip to the composer and fires a toast (seen live only); (4) separate conversation channels as tabs with different audiences ('Studio only' has a lock icon, and an audience strip under the tabs says who can see it); (5) a right 'Reconcile before you reply' decision panel with option cards giving trade-offs and Recommended/Not recommended pills, date chips with a SUGGESTED tag, and a v4 change checklist built from thread requests. Role pills (CLIENT in blue, STUDIO in purple) and small teal version tags on each message. Muted deep-teal primary colour, warm off-white backgrounds, red used only for attention states."
